1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,719
Let's be honest, most of us start our day feeling rushed. The alarm goes off, we grab

2
00:00:06,719 --> 00:00:14,040
our phones, and immediately we see emails, news, and social media. Before we even brush

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:20,839
our teeth, our brains are already stressed. We start worrying about meetings or comparing

4
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:27,400
our lives to other people. But what if you could take back that first hour? Your morning

5
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:35,439
isn't just about finishing work. It's about how you feel. Happiness is not a lucky accident.

6
00:00:35,439 --> 00:00:40,159
It is something you build with small daily choices.

7
00:00:40,159 --> 00:00:46,560
Today on Passport Motivation, we are looking at 5 Morning Habits. Science shows these habits

8
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:55,840
help you feel happier, lower your stress, and help you start the day your way.

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:01:02,840
Habit 1. Practice Mindfulness. This just means having a quiet time before

10
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:09,760
the busy day starts. Instead of looking at your phone, sit quietly for 5 minutes. You

11
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:15,800
can sit on your bed or a chair, close your eyes, and just feel your breath. This simple

12
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:21,240
practice calms your brain and helps you control your thoughts, instead of letting your thoughts

13
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:27,239
control you. Habit 2. Write down 3 Things You Are Thankful

14
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:32,399
For Our brains often focus on the bad things first.

15
00:01:32,399 --> 00:01:38,119
We have to teach our brains to see the good things. Get a notebook and write down 3 specific

16
00:01:38,119 --> 00:01:43,479
things you like. It could be the warm sun or the smell of your coffee. When you feel

17
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:51,920
thankful, your brain starts looking for good opportunities instead of problems.

18
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:57,880
Habit 3. Move Your Body. Moving is the fastest way to change how you

19
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:05,880
feel. Even 5 minutes of movement, like stretching or walking in place, creates happy chemicals

20
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:12,240
in your brain. These chemicals make you feel better naturally. By moving early, you tell

21
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:20,080
your brain, I have energy and I am ready for today.

22
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:28,000
Habit 4. Drink Water Before Coffee. After sleeping for 8 hours, your body needs

23
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:34,080
water. Many people drink coffee first, but coffee on an empty stomach can make you feel

24
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:40,920
more stressed. Make a simple rule. Drink a large glass of water before you touch your

25
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:48,839
coffee. It wakes up your body and helps your brain think clearly.

26
00:02:48,839 --> 00:02:56,759
Habit 5. Get 10 Minutes of Natural Light. Your body has an internal clock that controls

27
00:02:56,759 --> 00:03:03,839
your mood. To set this clock, your eyes need to see natural light in the morning. Step outside

28
00:03:03,839 --> 00:03:10,879
for 10 minutes. This helps your body create serotonin. A hormone that makes you feel good

29
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:17,879
It also helps you sleep better at night.

30
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:22,799
Happiness is not a place you arrive at. It is a way of living. You don't have to do

31
00:03:22,799 --> 00:03:30,159
all 5 habits tomorrow. Just pick one. Do it for one week, then add another one. In one

32
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:39,159
month, you won't just be surviving your mornings, you will be enjoying them.

33
00:03:39,159 --> 00:03:44,740
Which habit will you start with? Tell me in the comments. Don't forget to like and

